<title>UK: ASW to sell units to Philip Environmental.</title>
<headline>ASW to sell units to Philip Environmental.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's ASW Holdings Plc said on Monday it conditionally agreed to sell its metal recycling operations to Canada's Philip Environmental Inc for a total of 33 million stg in cash.</p>
</text>
